{"version": 1, "sourceSha256": "b35c92f61d3b8e9fc77deb22f4b725993dd7eb5a7af30604f6102f4d5818b696", "documents": [{"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}, {"id": "offline-b35c92f61d3b8e9fc77d", "filename": "12-Part C.mp3", "sha256": "b35c92f61d3b8e9fc77deb22f4b725993dd7eb5a7af30604f6102f4d5818b696", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-5/b35c92f61d3b8e9fc77deb22f4b725993dd7eb5a7af30604f6102f4d5818b696.mp3", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/b35c92f61d3b8e9fc77deb22f4b725993dd7eb5a7af30604f6102f4d5818b696.json", "format": "mp3", "role": "recording"}], "units": [{"id": "jahshan-1UtVaVpV9ylLyfXAitJ-YHsoH241bKvLL-C-1", "label": "Jahshan set 12 · Part C · Extract 1", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "pages": [144, 145], "questions": [{"number": 1, "prompt": "What is the stated purpose of the talk?\nA To evaluate if the audience are feeling burnout\nB To inform and stimulate discussion about burnout\nC To describe new research on treatment of burnout", "sourcePage": 144, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 149, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 2, "prompt": "What did the research from the Mayo Clinic show?\nA In 2011 more than half of US doctors claimed to have burnt out.\nB The large number of doctors with burnout is continuing to rise.\nC Typically one aspect of a doctors work makes them burn out.", "sourcePage": 144, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 149, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "What is the Anna Capstone's attitude to the problem of burnout?\nA Most doctors can handle burnout.\nB Doctors with burnout should retire.\nC Burnout endangers patients and doctors.", "sourcePage": 144, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 149, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "How does Anna Capstone think the problem of burnout should be addressed?\nA Hospitals should fund wellness programs for burnt out staff.\nB Multiple strategies are needed to keep doctors functioning and healthy.\nC By discouraging doctors from losing empathy and making mistakes.", "sourcePage": 145, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 149, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "How does Anna Capstone evaluate the role of administrative technology and regulations?\nA As a cheap and reliable way of collecting payment.\nB As confusing and stressful for doctors.\nC As something few doctors have really complained about.", "sourcePage": 145, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 149, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "Anna Capston argues that protecting the well-being of highly trained medical staff\nA is an ethical issue.\nB isn't part of workplace safety.\nC will require too many resources.\n\nE2 Language Part C.3 Extract 2", "sourcePage": 145, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 149, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["b35c92f61d3b8e9fc77deb22f4b725993dd7eb5a7af30604f6102f4d5818b696"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Exact original recording SHA-256 in the verified Jahshan collection"}, {"id": "jahshan-1UtVaVpV9ylLyfXAitJ-YHsoH241bKvLL-C-2", "label": "Jahshan set 12 · Part C · Extract 2", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "pages": [146, 147], "questions": [{"number": 1, "prompt": "Dr MacGregor believes that\nA most people will find the healthiest diet quite surprising.\nB intake of meat, eggs, and dairy is an essential part of a balanced diet.\nC the public is quite well informed about the ideal foods for a healthy diet.", "sourcePage": 146, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 149, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 2, "prompt": "What is Dr MacGregor's attitude to dieting?\nA More people should go on diets.\nB Dieting is a lifestyle choice.\nC Diets are generally ineffective.", "sourcePage": 146, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 149, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "Which industry first \"used science against itself\"?\nA The meat industry.\nB The egg industry.\nC The tobacco industry.\n\nth", "sourcePage": 146, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 149, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "According to Dr MacGregor, in the mid 20 century\nA the public respected and trusted science to reveal the truth.\nB smokers clearly understood the risks associated with tobacco use.\nC the US Surgeon General first reported on the cancer risk from smoking.", "sourcePage": 147, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 149, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "According to Dr MacGregor the tobacco industry\nA gathered a mass of evidence on the dangers of smoking.\nB used its influence to slow down government responses.\nC has finally recognised that smoking causes lung cancer.", "sourcePage": 147, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 149, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "The article suggests that the tobacco and food industries share which tactic?\nA Funding their own research to confuse people.\nB Using the motto \"doubt is our product\".\nC Denying evidence that their products are bad.", "sourcePage": 147, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 149, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 7, "prompt": "What do the healthiest and longest living communities in the world have in common?\nA they eat a lot of legumes.\nB they are religious communities.\nC they have a 97% plant-based diet.", "sourcePage": 147, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question"}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["b35c92f61d3b8e9fc77deb22f4b725993dd7eb5a7af30604f6102f4d5818b696"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Exact original recording SHA-256 in the verified Jahshan collection"}]}
